   >> The little dog was sad because| he could not eat the big cake. / Max had an idea. He went to the little dog and said, "Let's play and eat the cake together!" The big dog agreed and they started to play with the cake. They had so much fun, and they forgot about the cake. / But then, the cake fell from the sky and broke into pieces. All the animals were sad. Max learned that he should ask before taking something that was not his. The moral of the story is to always ask before taking something that is not yours, and being helpful to others can make everyone happy
